WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:04.700
No, the world does not come to an end. The world is just going to Coachella.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.040
*Intro*

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.560
and I'm trying to be part of society.

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:12.820
Hey guys, my name is Grace Helbig. If you did not know, now you know.

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.960
Welcome to my after-school special [laughs]

00:00:15.009 --> 00:00:16.720
This is my gang sign.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.120
Music festival season is upon us.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:23.540
This is when all the clearance sh*t from Halloween gets a huge...

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.620
second chance. [laughs]

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.560
I've been to a music festival or two in my day-

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:31.380
Literally only two. I've been to two music festivals.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.900
So I know what I'm talking about. Two is enough.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:37.100
People have two kids and they talk like they know how to have all kids.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:38.800
They do. Who am I to judge?

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:43.440
So I've created a list of seven Coachella essentials, but these work for any music festival

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:45.620
that you're going to, because Spoiler Alert:

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:47.300
[whispers] They're all exactly the same.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:49.040
Guitar! Unique, quirky.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:52.340
Let's get into it. The first thing you need are cute sunglasses!

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:56.840
These are essential because most music festivals, if not all music festivals, take place outside

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.579
so you need to protect your eyes against the sun.

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:01.980
I recommend getting a cheap pair of sunglasses

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:04.860
because it's super easy to lose them at music festivals

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:08.840
and cheaper sunglasses are easier to break apart and turn into a

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.160
series of shivs that you can use as weapons to protect yourself.

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:14.520
Next on the list is sunscreen.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:17.060
You're going to be in extreme direct sunlight,

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:18.660
so you want to protect your skin.

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:24.380
Also, sunscreen is slightly edible if you find yourself in a situation in which you need to eat it to survive...

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:29.040
...And there's lots of varieties. They all taste the same:

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:29.740
like sh*t.

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:33.160
Next: cute and comfortable closed-toed shoes.

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:37.460
Yes, you might want to wear those really cute, but really uncomfortable

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:39.440
open-toed gladiator sandals,

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:41.780
but the walk to the main music fairgrounds

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:44.460
is a lot longer and dustier than you realize.

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:47.900
The walk is also a lot longer and dustier than you realize

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:50.970
when the earth as you know it has been destroyed, and you have no actual home

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:53.400
and you're just trying to find a safe place.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.220
How far away that'll be, you don't know.

00:01:55.220 --> 00:01:58.340
So invest in some cute closed-toed shoes or lightweight boots.

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:02.580
They'll also help you protect your toenails so that you can eventually use them as currency if need be.

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:04.620
Next - A cute backpack!

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:09.520
You wanna make sure that you have a bag that's big enough for all the things that you might need throughout the day:

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:11.580
your 'stabby' sunglasses,

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:15.920
extra pair of closed-toed shoes to protect your toenail currency...

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:17.680
...Et cetera, et cetera, et cetera, the list goes on.

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:19.620
Also backpacks are great because

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:20.520
they keep your hands free

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:22.820
so you can dance as much as you want to,

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:25.100
and you can also fight for your life if you need to.

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:32.860
Next - a bandana.

00:02:32.860 --> 00:02:35.600
Music festivals are so much dustier than you think,

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:36.840
especially Coachella.

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:40.760
So bandanas can protect you from the dust, can protect your neck from the sun,

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:45.300
and align you with the appropriate gang when your only key to survival is choosing the right side.

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:49.900
And the last thing you'll need for Coachella or any music festival is: a fake tan!

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:52.100
I use the 'St. Tropez self-tan Express'.

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:56.920
I love it. It doesn't streak. It's easy to apply. It doesn't get all over everything.

00:02:57.020 --> 00:03:00.820
It's wonderful to give you a natural tan, a natural glow.

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:04.540
The color also blends into dirt like, perfectly.

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:08.000
So if you need to like strip down naked and lay face down in the dirt

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.900
as a means to camouflage yourself so that you're not murdered,

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:13.280
this is the perfect product for you.

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:17.160
So there you go, there are my seven essentials that every person needs

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:20.160
for Coachella or any music festival. I hope these were helpful.

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:25.140
Let me know which is your favorite, or which else I should have included in this list,

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:26.460
and I'll see you guys at Coachella!

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:27.600
Sike, I won't be there.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:28.860
At all. Whatsoever.

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:29.459
I don't know.

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:33.009
Also, I have been watching a lot of The Walking Dead,

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:37.000
and it is very likely that I got Coachella confused with The Walking Dead,

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:42.070
but I don't see much of a difference: a lot of dust-covered people

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:43.440
doing this

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.980
and just all sort of looking at each other like,

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:50.630
"Should we just

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:53.040
kill ourselves? Do we really have to be here?"

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:55.380
[laughs] I'm kidding...

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:58.990
The Walking Dead looks like a much better time!

